@slug teacher-registration
@title Teacher Registration Form
@provisional Section 1 matches the live form; sections 2–12 are provisional until the full form is uploaded.
## Personal Details
Full Name* | text
Gender | radio | Female; Male; Prefer not to say; Other
Date of Birth | date
Profile Photograph* | file
Mobile Number* | tel
WhatsApp Number | tel
Email Address* | email
Current City* | text
Current District | text
State* | state
PIN Code | pincode
## Professional Summary
Professional Headline* | text | | e.g. CBSE Mathematics Teacher, Grades 6–10
About Me* | textarea | | 80–150 words about your teaching philosophy and strengths
Total Teaching Experience* | radio | Fresher; Less than 1 year; 1–3 years; 3–5 years; 5–10 years; 10–20 years; More than 20 years
Current Employment Status* | radio | Employed (school); Employed (other education organisation); Freelance / Tutor; Looking for opportunities; Career break; Retired
Current Designation | text
Current School / Organisation | text
## Educational Qualifications
Highest Qualification* | radio | Diploma; Graduate; Postgraduate; M.Phil.; Ph.D.; Other
Qualifications | repeat 5 | Degree / Qualification, Subject / Specialisation, University / Institution, Year of Completion:year
## Teaching Qualifications & Eligibility
Teaching Qualifications | checkbox | B.Ed.; M.Ed.; D.El.Ed.; NTT / ECCE; Montessori Training; B.P.Ed. / M.P.Ed.; Special Education (RCI); Other; None
Teacher Eligibility Tests Cleared | checkbox | CTET; State TET; None
TET / CTET Details | text | | Paper, year and score (optional)
## Teaching Profile
Subjects You Teach* | checkbox | Mathematics; Science; Physics; Chemistry; Biology; English; Hindi; Kannada; Tamil; Telugu; Malayalam; Marathi; Sanskrit; French; German; Social Science; History; Geography; Economics; Accountancy; Business Studies; Computer Science; Coding / AI; EVS; General Knowledge; Art & Craft; Music; Dance; Physical Education; Yoga; Life Skills; Other
Grades / Levels Taught* | checkbox | Pre-primary; Primary (1–5); Middle (6–8); Secondary (9–10); Senior Secondary (11–12)
Boards / Curricula Experience* | checkbox | $BOARDS
Languages You Can Teach In* | checkbox | $LANG9
Teaching Methods | checkbox | Activity-based learning; Experiential learning; Project-based learning; Inquiry-based learning; Flipped classroom; Differentiated instruction; Blended / digital teaching; Inclusive classroom practices
## Work Experience
Work Experience | repeat 8 | School / Organisation, Designation, Board, From (year):year, To (year or Present), Subjects & Grades, Key Responsibilities & Achievements:textarea
## Skills & Certifications
Digital Skills | checkbox | Google Workspace / Classroom; Microsoft 365 / Teams; Smart board; LMS platforms; Canva / content creation; AI tools for teaching; Online assessment tools; Video lessons
Additional Responsibilities Handled | checkbox | Class teacher; Subject coordinator; Exam coordinator; Olympiad / competition mentor; Club in-charge; House master / mistress; Admissions support; Parent communication; Event management; Mentoring new teachers
Certifications & Trainings | repeat 8 | Certification / Training, Issuing Body, Year:year
## Achievements
Awards & Recognition | textarea
Student Outcomes / Results | textarea
Publications, Workshops or Talks | textarea
## Job Preferences
Open to New Opportunities* | yesno
Preferred Roles | checkbox | Pre-primary Teacher; Primary Teacher (PRT); Trained Graduate Teacher (TGT); Post Graduate Teacher (PGT); Special Educator; Counsellor; Coordinator; Vice Principal; Principal; Online Tutor; Curriculum Developer; Teacher Trainer
Preferred Job Type | checkbox | Full-time; Part-time; Contract; Online / Remote; Substitute / Visiting
Preferred Locations | text
Willing to Relocate | yesno
Expected Salary (per month) | text | | Kept private; shared only with schools you apply to
Notice Period | radio | Immediate; 15 days; 1 month; 2 months; 3 months
## Online Presence & Documents
LinkedIn Profile | url
Portfolio / Demo Lesson Link | url
Upload CV (optional) | file | | You can also generate a CV with AI from your profile
Qualification Certificates | files
Experience Letters | files
## Safeguarding & Verification
Are you willing to undergo background verification by schools you apply to?* | yesno
Have you completed child-safeguarding / POCSO awareness training? | radio | Yes; No; Willing to complete
## Declaration & Consent
Declaration* | consent | | I confirm that the information provided is true and accurate, and I understand that The School Expert™ may verify the details and documents submitted.
Profile visibility* | radio | Visible to verified schools only; Visible on the public teacher directory (name, headline, subjects, city); Hidden (I will apply to jobs myself)
Community guidelines* | consent | | I agree to follow The School Expert™ Teachers Community guidelines, including respectful conduct and never sharing student personal information.
